   "answer": "October so far is ahead of the same days of September on cash collected (+6%) and jobs started, but completed revenue is far lower, mostly because October's work has not been invoiced yet.\n\n::: compare\ntitle: October so far vs the same days of September\nperiods: Oct 1–27 | Sep 1–27\nCash collected | $19,405 | $18,300 | +6% | good\nJobs started | 11 | 10 | +10% | good\nValue of jobs started | $48,960 | $52,996 | -7.6% | bad\nCompleted revenue | $13,050 | $41,426 | -68.5% | bad\nEstimates created | 7 | 4 | +75% | good\nWin rate | 50% | 66.7% | -16.7 pts | bad\nExpenses | $5,520 | $4,130 | +33.7% | bad\nCallback visits | 3 | 1 | +200% | bad\n:::\n\n- **Completed revenue and the win rate read low for October:** both count jobs and estimates by today's status, and October's have had less time to be invoiced or decided.\n- **More estimates out:** 7 created worth $89,300, against 4 worth $49,250.\n- **Expenses are up $1,390.**\n\n::: basis\nJobs and estimates by start date, cash by payment date. Completed = Final Invoice Sent, Paid & Closed, Paid in Full, Close Job or Google Review Sent.\n:::\n\n::: followups\nWhich October jobs are waiting to be invoiced?\nShow cash collected by week\n:::",
